  "body": "~~(The whitespace-ignorant diff is easier to read)~~\nThis replaces the redundant \"base URL must be in scope\" requirement with a non-normative note ~~and an explicit _base-URL-is-null?_ check in the _relative state_ of the parsing algorithm.~~\n\nThis avoids an extraneous concept of scope ~~and further clarifies the behavior of the parser when the URL is relative but there is no base URL.~~\n",
